Land Use:Variances/Board App./Plats
2.
PUBLIC HEARING regarding a review and recommendation of the
Subdivision Permit and Plat for Deer Valley at Chalk Bluff Subdivision
24 - 414
PZ-24-00059 PC Meeting Packet 8.8.24
Attachments:
Cate Cundall, Associate Planner, said that Steil Services, LLC, on behalf of
Community Investment, Inc. submitted a Subdivision Permit and Plat application for
Deer Valley at Chalk Bluff Subdivision, located at 3371 Road 203. The purposes of
the application is to divide the 40 acre tract into 4 residential tracts averaging 10
acres each. The subdivision will be accessed via Road 203 onto an 80 foot access
and utility easement which will be privately maintained. Water and sanitary sewer will
be provided by individual wells and septic systems.
Shane Hansen, applicants agent, was present to answer questions on the project.
